* mv_cmd — a command framework for MultiValue BASIC (cut-down copy bundled in
* mvpkg so it runs standalone; the full mvx-lang/cmd overrides it when installed).
* Copyright (C) 2026 Gordon Heydon.  GPL-2.0-only (see LICENSE).
*
* CMD.INIT(name, description) — begin defining a command.  Platform-neutral (no
* idiom diff), so this one source compiles for both MVX and UniData.
   SUBROUTINE CMD.INIT(NAME, DESC)
   COMMON /CMDPKG/ CNAME, CDESC, CSUBS, CDESCS, CHANDLERS
   CNAME = NAME
   CDESC = DESC
   CSUBS = ""
   CDESCS = ""
   CHANDLERS = ""
   RETURN